        "x1": 0.2565580031451057,
        "y1": 0.5315258511979823
      },
      "text": "E-mail: changhkg@ns.kosinmed.or.kr",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3444705995191045,
        "y0": 0.5208956127960475,
        "x1": 0.48276551831670167,
        "y1": 0.5322449192273211
      },
      "text": "Esophageal neoplasms",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11509244261669511,
        "y0": 0.5695964721833622,
        "x1": 0.47978345085592833,
        "y1": 0.5834678467104745
      },
      "text": "Esophageal cancer is the 9th most common cancer in Korean",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697868795956,
        "y0": 0.5695936628728917,
        "x1": 0.8971753545168067,
        "y1": 0.5834650374000039
      },
      "text": "one DNA replication per cycle. The MCM complex combines",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080649111451222,
        "y0": 0.5872505640171816,
        "x1": 0.13797724106732537,
        "y1": 0.6011219385442939
      },
      "text": "males.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13801681133879332,
        "y0": 0.5885119829021517,
        "x1": 0.14255462133583902,
        "y1": 0.5960781871896674
      },
      "text": "1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1459663839901195,
        "y0": 0.5872509488542323,
        "x1": 0.4798209951705292,
        "y1": 0.6011223233813445
      },
      "text": "Squamous cell carcinoma is the most common histologi-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697868795956,
        "y0": 0.5872477547067111,
        "x1": 0.8972801913734244,
        "y1": 0.6011191292338234
      },
      "text": "with the origin recognition complex, Cdc 6, and Cdt 1 to form",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080741433536305,
        "y0": 0.6049050406880516,
        "x1": 0.47978111074752167,
        "y1": 0.6187764152151639
      },
      "text": "cal type worldwide, including in Korea. Risk factors thus far",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697868795956,
        "y0": 0.6049018465405305,
        "x1": 0.749355899586397,
        "y1": 0.6187732210676427
      },
      "text": "the prereplicative complex (pre-RC).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7493109182149422,
        "y0": 0.6061664595730217,
        "x1": 0.7669248949579832,
        "y1": 0.6137326638605376
      },
      "text": "6-10",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7727730887276786,
        "y0": 0.6049054255251025,
        "x1": 0.8975779813878676,
        "y1": 0.6187768000522147
      },
      "text": "Once the pre-RC is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080741433536305,
        "y0": 0.6225591325218711,
        "x1": 0.47951655668370863,
        "y1": 0.6364305070489833
      },
      "text": "identified are cigarettes, alcohol, lack of vitamin A, C, and E,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.6225595173589218,
        "x1": 0.8973317891609769,
        "y1": 0.636430891886034
      },
      "text": "built up, the initiation of DNA replication is permitted. Dur-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080741433536305,
        "y0": 0.6402132243556904,
        "x1": 0.47971284369460676,
        "y1": 0.6540845988828026
      },
      "text": "lack of folic acid, a history of achalasia, corrosive esophagosteno-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.6402136091927412,
        "x1": 0.8975198184742647,
        "y1": 0.6540849837198535
      },
      "text": "ing DNA synthesis, the MCM complex dissociates from the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080741433536305,
        "y0": 0.6578673161895098,
        "x1": 0.47974448965377164,
        "y1": 0.6717386907166221
      },
      "text": "sis, hyperkeratosis, Plummer-Vinson syndrome, and head and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.6578677010265606,
        "x1": 0.8973368155856093,
        "y1": 0.6717390755536727
      },
      "text": "replication origin, thereby preventing replication from occur-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080741433536305,
        "y0": 0.6755214080233292,
        "x1": 0.18138176413143384,
        "y1": 0.6893927825504413
      },
      "text": "neck tumors.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18131091975364363,
        "y0": 0.6767843662565023,
        "x1": 0.1942681961700696,
        "y1": 0.684350570544018
      },
      "text": "2-4",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20010083623293068,
        "y0": 0.675523332208583,
        "x1": 0.4799397444524685,
        "y1": 0.6893947067356951
      },
      "text": "The esophagus lacks a serosal layer, although",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.6755217928603798,
        "x1": 0.8802089146205357,
        "y1": 0.6893931673874921
      },
      "text": "ring until the cell achieves the G1 phase of the next cycle.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.880336011357668,
        "y0": 0.6767843662565023,
        "x1": 0.8976123457195379,
        "y1": 0.684350570544018
      },
      "text": "6-10",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080633724437041,
        "y0": 0.6931774240424022,
        "x1": 0.48023425831514244,
        "y1": 0.7070487985695145
      },
      "text": "the lymphatic channels are well-developed, and early-stage",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.693177808879453,
        "x1": 0.8973384568671219,
        "y1": 0.7070491834065653
      },
      "text": "MCM proteins are thought to be useful markers for prolifera-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080633724437041,
        "y0": 0.7108315158762216,
        "x1": 0.47970684275907627,
        "y1": 0.7247028904033339
      },
      "text": "esophageal cancer spreads readily into the adjacent organs, thus",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.7108319007132724,
        "x1": 0.8974565265559349,
        "y1": 0.7247032752403846
      },
      "text": "tion, as it has been demonstrated in replicating but not quies-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080633724437041,
        "y0": 0.728485607710041,
        "x1": 0.47970350890600383,
        "y1": 0.7423569822371532
      },
      "text": "resulting in an overall poor prognosis. This poor prognosis issue",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697355895484,
        "y0": 0.7284859925470917,
        "x1": 0.5764835646172531,
        "y1": 0.742357367074204
      },
      "text": "cent cells.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.7297477962691126,
        "x1": 0.5978164801076681,
        "y1": 0.7373140005566283
      },
      "text": "11-13",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6018991678702731,
        "y0": 0.7284867622211932,
        "x1": 0.8973185563287815,
        "y1": 0.7423581367483054
      },
      "text": "Additionally, MCM proteins are utilized as mark-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080633724437041,
        "y0": 0.7461396995438603,
        "x1": 0.4797151004566866,
        "y1": 0.7600110740709726
      },
      "text": "persists, despite recent improvements in surgical methods and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183697868795956,
        "y0": 0.7461408540550126,
        "x1": 0.8341814313616072,
        "y1": 0.7600122285821248
      },
      "text": "ers for the diagnosis of invasive cancer and carcinoma",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.834201434480042,
        "y0": 0.7461408540550126,
        "x1": 0.8682158654477415,
        "y1": 0.7600122285821248
      },
      "text": "in situ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8682524865414916,
        "y0": 0.7461408540550126,
        "x1": 0.897303579634979,
        "y1": 0.7600122285821248
      },
      "text": ". Re-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080633724437041,
        "y0": 0.7637937913776797,
        "x1": 0.22079268383378742,
        "y1": 0.777665165904792
      },
      "text": "therapeutic agents.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22075631277901786,
        "y0": 0.7650567496108528,
        "x1": 0.22529412277606356,
        "y1": 0.7726229538983685
      },
      "text": "5",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.231025221367844,
        "y0": 0.7637957155629335,
        "x1": 0.48009587135635506,
        "y1": 0.7776670900900458
      },
      "text": "Although several previous studies have",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183698381696429,
        "y0": 0.763794945888832,
        "x1": 0.8973485097163866,
        "y1": 0.7776663204159442
      },
      "text": "cent studies have demonstrated an increase in MCM proteins in",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1008061128504136,
        "y0": 0.7814498073967528,
        "x1": 0.47967825496897976,
        "y1": 0.795321181923865
      },
      "text": "focused on the identification of prognostic molecular markers",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183698381696429,
        "y0": 0.7814490377226513,
        "x1": 0.8972270548844538,
        "y1": 0.7953204122497636
      },
      "text": "malignant tumors such as adenocarcinoma of the lung, colon,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1008061128504136,
        "y0": 0.7991038992305722,
        "x1": 0.4796532767159598,
        "y1": 0.8129752737576844
      },
      "text": "in this cancer, no significant prognostic markers have yet been",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183698381696429,
        "y0": 0.7991031295564707,
        "x1": 0.8972570082720588,
        "y1": 0.812974504083583
      },
      "text": "and prostate, papillary thyroid carcinoma and endometrial car-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1008061128504136,
        "y0": 0.8167579910643916,
        "x1": 0.165999699440323,
        "y1": 0.8306293655915038
      },
      "text": "identified.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183698381696429,
        "y0": 0.8167572213902901,
        "x1": 0.5657933339351365,
        "y1": 0.8306285959174022
      },
      "text": "cinoma.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5658151322052258,
        "y0": 0.8180201796234632,
        "x1": 0.5874106014476103,
        "y1": 0.8255863839109789
      },
      "text": "11-16",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5917814879858193,
        "y0": 0.8167591455755439,
        "x1": 0.8973054260766806,
        "y1": 0.830630520102656
      },
      "text": "A few studies have also evaluated the expression of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1150920579413406,
        "y0": 0.8344120925191372,
        "x1": 0.4800625969381893,
        "y1": 0.8482834670462494
      },
      "text": "The minichromosome maintenance (MCM) complex is a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183700946198792,
        "y0": 0.8344132470302894,
        "x1": 0.8972754726890756,
        "y1": 0.8482846215574017
      },
      "text": "MCM 2, 4, and 5 in esophageal squamous cell carcinoma, but,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080610643915769,
        "y0": 0.8520661939738828,
        "x1": 0.4799628313849954,
        "y1": 0.865937568500995
      },
      "text": "DNA-binding heterohexamer complex formed by minichro-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183700946198792,
        "y0": 0.8520673484850351,
        "x1": 0.897310452501313,
        "y1": 0.8659387230121474
      },
      "text": "to the best of our knowledge, no research into MCM 7 expres-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080610643915769,
        "y0": 0.8697202954286284,
        "x1": 0.47964498696207,
        "y1": 0.8835916699557407
      },
      "text": "mosome maintenance proteins 2-7 (MCM 2-7). The MCM com-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183700946198792,
        "y0": 0.8697214499397807,
        "x1": 0.8971540178571429,
        "y1": 0.8835928244668929
      },
      "text": "sion in esophageal carcinoma has been reported thus far in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10080610643915769,
        "y0": 0.887374396883374,
        "x1": 0.47978639362239034,
        "y1": 0.9012457714104862
      },
      "text": "plex functions as a “licensing factor,” which allows the initia-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183700946198792,
        "y0": 0.8873755513945263,
        "x1": 0.6859712488511029,
        "y1": 0.9012469259216386
      },
      "text": "English-language literature.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
